       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. JOBGEN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT JOB-OUT ASSIGN TO JOBOUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD JOB-OUT.
       01 JOB-CARD            PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ARG              PIC X(40).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-ARG FROM COMMAND-LINE
           OPEN OUTPUT JOB-OUT
           STRING '//RUN EXEC PGM=' WS-ARG DELIMITED BY SIZE
              INTO JOB-CARD
           WRITE JOB-CARD
           CLOSE JOB-OUT
           GOBACK.
